WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Channels” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose the channel
From Settings & channels open Channels and choose YouTube.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Complete the authorization
Press connect and complete the sign-in in the provider's window. Choose the business account or page you need and grant the permissions shown. If the connection isn't available, contact support.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Review the connection and test
Go back to Channels and check the connection. Test receiving a message or a comment, depending on the channel type and its permissions.
